  <div class="ps-grid">
    <div class="ps-problems">
      <div class="ps-problem">
        <div class="ps-x">✕</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Store Setup Nahin Pata</h3>
          <p>Amazon/Flipkart pe account banana, products list karna � sab confusing lagta hai.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ps-problem">
        <div class="ps-x">✕</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Kaunse Products Bechein?</h3>
          <p>Wrong product choose karne pe time aur paisa dono barbad. Research karna mushkil hai.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ps-problem">
        <div class="ps-x">✕</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Dispatch &amp; Operations Ka Jhanjhat</h3>
          <p>Orders manage karna, suppliers se deal karna � sab akele karna impossible lagta hai.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ps-problem">
        <div class="ps-x">✕</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Koi Guide Nahin Hai</h3>
          <p>YouTube videos dekhte hain, courses khareedte hain � lekin practically kuch nahi hota.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ps-solution">
      <span class="ps-dot"></span>
      <div class="ps-bulb">💡</div>
      <h3>DROPSHIP GURU KA SOLUTION</h3>
      <p>Hum sirf course nahi dete � hum aapko poora business setup aur chalana step-by-step sikhate hain.</p>
      <div class="ps-checklist">
        <div>Store setup se leke dispatch tak � sab hum</div>
        <div>Winning products humari research team dhundti hai</div>
        <div>Dedicated WhatsApp support, real humans</div>
        <div>Pehli sale tak step-by-step guidance aur support</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

