<!-- 30-DAY ROADMAP -->
<section class="process-section section reveal" id="roadmap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="pill">Your 30-Day Journey</span>
    <h2>From Zero To Your First Sale</h2>
    <p>A complete, day-by-day 30-day action plan we walk through with you � from setup to your first real orders.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="roadmap-intro">
    <span class="roadmap-badge">📅 30 Days � 4 Weeks</span>
    <span class="roadmap-badge">🎯 Goal: First Sale Within 30 Days</span>
    <span class="roadmap-badge">🤝 1-on-1 Support Included</span>
  </div>

  <div class="roadmap-weeks">

    <!-- Week 1 -->
    <div class="week-card week-1">
      <span class="week-tag">Week 1 � Foundation</span>
      <h3>Setup &amp; Research</h3>
      <span class="week-range">Day 1 � Day 7</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Free 1-on-1 consultation call to understand your goals &amp; budget</li>
        <li>Niche selection &amp; winning product research</li>
        <li>Supplier sourcing &amp; pricing finalization</li>
        <li>Business profile setup (WhatsApp / Instagram / Marketplace)</li>
        <li>Store / page branding � logo, bio, theme</li>
        <li>Domain &amp; basic store structure ready</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Week 2 -->
    <div class="week-card week-2">
      <span class="week-tag">Week 2 � Build</span>
      <h3>Store &amp; Listings Go Live</h3>
      <span class="week-range">Day 8 � Day 14</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Full store / catalog setup with product listings</li>
        <li>Product titles, descriptions &amp; images optimized for SEO</li>
        <li>Payment gateway &amp; order process connected</li>
        <li>WhatsApp auto-reply &amp; broadcast lists configured</li>
        <li>Social media content calendar created</li>
        <li>Store goes LIVE and is ready to take orders</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Week 3 -->
    <div class="week-card week-3">
      <span class="week-tag">Week 3 � Launch</span>
      <h3>Traffic &amp; First Orders</h3>
      <span class="week-range">Day 15 � Day 21</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Ad campaigns launched (Meta / Google Ads)</li>
        <li>Organic content &amp; reels posted with viral hooks</li>
        <li>Hashtag &amp; outreach strategy executed</li>
        <li>Daily order &amp; inquiry monitoring with you</li>
        <li>First customer messages &amp; orders start coming in</li>
        <li>Quick fixes &amp; A/B testing on ads and listings</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Week 4 -->
    <div class="week-card week-4">
      <span class="week-tag">Week 4 � Scale</span>
      <h3>Optimize &amp; Grow Income</h3>
      <span class="week-range">Day 22 � Day 30</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Performance review � what's working, what to scale</li>
        <li>Budget reallocation to best-performing products/ads</li>
        <li>Customer feedback &amp; review collection system</li>
        <li>Repeat customer &amp; retention strategy set up</li>
        <li>Growth roadmap for Month 2 handed to you</li>
        <li>Final mentorship call � you're ready to scale on your own</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="roadmap-outcome">
    🚀 By <b>Day 30</b>, your business is fully set up and ready to take orders, and you have a clear growth plan to keep scaling � <b>with full support from our team every step of the way.</b>
  </div>
</section>

